(7410816, 1167970, 38032, '<td valign="top">great POV<br/>Taking a 2nd look at this challenge to dish out some bling. This one keeps coming back to me. The super-wide birds-eye view. The little broom. The garbage can. The people looking into the showcase. Seems to bring us back a few years. Love the wood grain floor and ability to spy into this little world. Have a babyface: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png"/></a></td>', 'great POVTaking a 2nd look at this challenge to dish out some bling. This one keeps coming back to me. The super-wide birds-eye view. The little broom. The garbage can. The people looking into the showcase. Seems to bring us back a few years. Love the wood grain floor and ability to spy into this little world. Have a babyface: ', '2015-10-19 12:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
