(7411276, 1167968, 170018, '<td valign="top">I have the same candle holder, but with Moomins instead of owls. :-) Those are fun to photograph. I wish you''ve used different angle, to show owl figures against some distant (dark) background.</td>', 'I have the same candle holder, but with Moomins instead of owls. :-) Those are fun to photograph. I wish you''ve used different angle, to show owl figures against some distant (dark) background.', '2015-10-21 00:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
