(7411290, 1167910, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys!<br/>12 comments !!!! and an award!!! It feels like old times...thank you.<br/> <br/>My gifted cat lulu leaping for Temptation cat treats. It''s been pointed out that it was not well executed but it<br/>was not easy getting her full silhouette in the mirror. I used an 18-85 lens but still had awkward ends.<br/> <br/>I vow to comment more. It makes such a difference in the way this game is played.<br/>Thanks!<br/></td>', 'Thanks guys!12 comments !!!! and an award!!! It feels like old times...thank you. My gifted cat lulu leaping for Temptation cat treats. It''s been pointed out that it was not well executed but itwas not easy getting her full silhouette in the mirror. I used an 18-85 lens but still had awkward ends. I vow to comment more. It makes such a difference in the way this game is played.Thanks!', '2015-10-21 01:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
